          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஆயுள் — āyuḷ — \"a lifespan\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நல்ல உணவு ஆயுளை அதிகரிக்கும். nalla uṇavu āyuḷai atikarikkum. Good food lengthens one’s life."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஆயுள் (āyuḷ) முழுவதும், all one’s life."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஆயுள் (āyuḷ) is usually traced to Sanskrit āyus, \"life, the length of life\"; our sources do not list the Tamil form."
            }
          ]
        },
